WEBVTT

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.402
I’m a life partner to a woman

00:00:31.402 --> 00:00:32.904
and I’m a Black man in America.

00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:35.698
Holding these identities --

00:00:35.698 --> 00:00:38.409
and many more --

00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:41.120
I say this call to action to you

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.413
with the deepest sincerity

00:00:42.413 --> 00:00:43.664
and utmost gravity.

00:00:45.374 --> 00:00:49.378
It is time for a gender reckoning,

00:00:49.378 --> 00:00:54.425
beginning with men authentically
confronting our internal selves

00:00:54.425 --> 00:00:55.760
and each other

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.261
through the toxicity within us.

00:00:58.471 --> 00:01:02.350
Against the backdrop
of Black Lives Matter protest,